 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Totally normal. Lots of people prefer walking or going somewhere green on public buses. Cycling is great one traffic isn't part of the picture about. How long is it? An hour on bike can beat it easily, and you' be out in fresh air. You' be at work before you know it. If it' more than two or three zones, bike trainers save your wheels and give you a real bike feel. You' need a bike that fits you, some gear for indoor riding, and a room quiet enough for the trainer to be heard. A short commute might even be fast enough on the bike that you'd surprise yourself.",
